{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id238607910"}, "name":{"label":"hulloitskai"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-04-29T04:06:00-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.2"}, "id":{"label":"1600564076"}, "title":{"label":"Excellent thus far - but could be better with Latex support"}, "content":{"label":"Bear already has features for code snippets built in, making it excellent coders, but should also consider including Latex math equation support, which would really give Bear the opportunity to become the primary note talking tool for uni students.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id43517141"}, "name":{"label":"Leda~"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-04-28T18:45:46-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.2"}, "id":{"label":"1600151826"}, "title":{"label":"I wish they had one-time-payment upgrade"}, "content":{"label":"Overall, Bear is good. It does what it says it does and it's been quite a useful help to me.  I want to pay for Bear, but the problem is that it's a subscription service. I don't want to pay every month because I don't have a Mac anyway so I don't need to sync, and paying a yearly fee for a service I use 10% of the features of is just too much. If there was, say, a $10 upgrade which gave all the features of Bear Pro except sync, I'd buy it in an instant.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
