{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id473043637"}, "name":{"label":"kvl_me"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-12-27T19:14:26-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.4"}, "id":{"label":"1510437762"}, "title":{"label":"First notes app I've fallen in love with"}, "content":{"label":"For such a young app Bear is fantastic. While it's not as full featured as other writing apps out there (intentionally) it offers a great suite of options. \n\nI was struggling to find something that combined what I appreciated about Byword (the design) with nvAlt (the functionality) with the cross platform support and sync (like Simplenote). Plus, the simple link/integration to Marked as a markdown previewer; awesome. \n\nI'm a fan of the subscription route compared to having to purchase 2 different apps and the flexibility of a free app for those only needing a single platform. \n\nI'm looking forward to the incremental updates and improvements. \n\nI've actually stopped looking for a text editor/note taker and have deleted 3 apps from my Mac and replaced it with this one.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id117678111"}, "name":{"label":"Just Graham again"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-12-21T22:52:39-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.4"}, "id":{"label":"1506552609"}, "title":{"label":"Clean and perfect"}, "content":{"label":"It just works so nice. It's the first note app that lets me write something more substantial than just a note. And helps keep them all organized 😁", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id339094306"}, "name":{"label":"Sushentalwarr"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-12-15T19:09:59-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.4"}, "id":{"label":"1502611763"}, "title":{"label":"Sync Issue"}, "content":{"label":"Getting people to pay for the \"Pro\" to get access to a feature is okay, but the feature needs to work! Notes don't sync from iPhone to Mac or vice versa.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id25421725"}, "name":{"label":"Spartickle"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-12-15T15:28:33-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.4"}, "id":{"label":"1502545608"}, "title":{"label":"Looks like a keeper"}, "content":{"label":"Importing more than thirteen hundred items from Evernote went off without a hitch, using the Mac version. I had no luck with iOS. Hence the four stars. Otherwise a clean, swift note taker and compendium. I like the hashtagging especially. It's familiar, fast and easy to edit. Classy looks and nearly flawless performance.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
