{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id188289073"}, "name":{"label":"Levko931"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-11-09T10:34:10-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"1481577024"}, "title":{"label":"Solid App"}, "content":{"label":"This is a very solid application. I use it for typing notes in class on my mac (it has an app on the mac app store that syncs) and I love it! Has a few little bugs-rare to find them and i assume they'll be fixed in future updates.\nThe reason I'm giving it ⅘ stars is because I would like to see more fonts and more kinds of lists, more ways to make a quick chart or diagram, etc.\nBut again, overall the app is amazing and has a great foundation with a lot of potential! Worth the download and even the 2$/month pro version to have it all backed up on the cloud and synced between all devices!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
